        "Solve for the real roots of $x$:\n$$x^2 = 4 \\implies x = 2 \\quad\\text{or}\\quad x = -2$$",
        "Evaluate $f(2)$ to find the coordinates of the first stationary point:\n$$f(2) = \\frac{2}{3}(8) - 7(2) + \\frac{4}{2} + 2 = \\frac{16}{3} - 10 = -\\frac{14}{3} \\implies \\left(2, -\\frac{14}{3}\\right)$$",
